OL,3,GNEWSAChance to meet newly-elected
OL,4,Apoliticians
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople will be able to meet politicians
OL,7,Fvoted in at Jersey's general election
OL,8,Fearlier this year as part of a
OL,9,Fweek-long event.
OL,11,FThe island's Democracy Week is being
OL,12,Fheld for the seventh time with a series
OL,13,Fof tours of the Royal Court and States
OL,14,FAssembly and walks discussing Jersey's
OL,15,Fpolitical history.
OL,17,FThe States Greffe said a new addition
OL,18,Fto the event will be three Democracy
OL,19,FCafe sessions for islanders to come
OL,20,Falong and discuss topics that are
OL,21,Fimportant to them.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
