OL,3,GNEWSAChance to meet newly-elected
OL,4,Apoliticians
OL,5,
OL,6,FJenny O'Brien, head of digital and
OL,7,Fpublic engagement at the States Greffe,
OL,8,Fsaid the week would be the "perfect
OL,9,Ftime" for people to meet newly-elected
OL,10,Fmembers of the States Assembly.
